cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use FARMWISE-API in research, please cite the software using this
  metadata. Replace the author placeholders before publishing a release.
title: FARMWISE-API
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "REPLACE WITH FAMILY NAME"
    given-names: "REPLACE WITH GIVEN NAMES"
    email: "replace-author@example.com"
    # Add an ORCID after the author has confirmed it, for example:
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/SmolakK/FARMWISE-API"
url: "https://github.com/SmolakK/FARMWISE-API"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  FARMWISE-API is a Python library and FastAPI service for selecting,
  retrieving, harmonising, and assessing European agricultural and
  environmental data in a common S2-cell representation.
keywords:
  - agriculture
  - environmental data
  - geospatial data
  - S2 geometry
  - data harmonisation
